  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>20</x>
      <y>1645</y>
      <w>1100</w>
      <h>270</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Stage 2 implementation
GUI and CLI enter through AgentFacade. All operations are course-scoped.
UC07 uses three Factory Method creators and bounded regeneration.
UC09 and UC10 retain PENDING until a valid grade or explicit self-assessment.
UC08 and UC11 use graded-only statistics and minimum sample sizes.
UC12 validates dates and budgets and requires diagnostics when evidence is insufficient.
UC14 restores progress and available history from saved study records.
UC15 supports six tools, saved sessions, result references and bounded recovery.
The model connection uses OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions.
style=wordwrap
bg=white
layer=2</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes />
  </element>
